- `src/water/ocean.js`: public API, LUT ocean shaders, shared-resource ownership, combined group/update/stats and real-coast test camera.
- `src/water/breakers.js`: seeded lifecycle data, instanced curl geometry, ballistic soft spray, shared uniforms and surf stats.
